1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,650
Excuse me, how can I get to the science building?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,512
Go straight along this path and turn left at the library.

3
00:00:07,512 --> 00:00:09,462
Is it far from here?

4
00:00:09,462 --> 00:00:11,875
About ten minutes on foot.

5
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:13,862
You cannot miss it.

